			title: "Pressure Is Stored Energy"
			description: ["PneumaticCraft does not treat air as a generic fluid. Machines and tubes form a pressurised network measured in bar. More pressure means more stored energy, but every component has a safe operating range; exceeding it can destroy parts of the network."]
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.2d
