			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2270000000000005"
			title: "Design a Controlled Pressure Loop"
			description: ["A robust pressure system has generation, storage volume, measurement, a consumer and an overpressure response. Prepare real volume, safety and measurement hardware before the Industrial Age pressure branch asks for sustained pneumatic processing; the guide now ends on tangible control hardware instead of a manual completion checkbox."]
